{"seq":27,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"bd177ce3-5e42-4755-b9d5-9b4ba8506ed1","runId":"run_1_1788434055091","result":"Done! I've created `/app/run.py` with the `run_tasks` function. Here's how it works:\n\n- **Semaphore-based concurrency**: Uses `asyncio.Semaphore` to limit how many tasks run at the same time\n- **Graceful cancellation**: When you interrupt with Ctrl+C, asyncio converts it to a `CancelledError`, which allows tasks' `try/finally` blocks to run their cleanup code before terminating\n- **Importable**: You can use `from run import run_tasks`\n\nFor cleanup to work when interrupted, your individual tasks should use `try/finally`:\n\n```python\nasync def my_task():\n    try:\n        await some_operation()\n    finally:\n        # cleanup happens here even during keyboard interrupt\n        pass\n```","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":18226,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"bd177ce3-5e42-4755-b9d5-9b4ba8506ed1","total_cost_usd":0.014147199999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2006,"cache_read_input_tokens":26187,"output_tokens":1581,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1090},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2006},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":451,"cache_read_input_tokens":13498,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1197,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1197,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1024,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001099,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":1581,"cacheReadInputTokens":2